        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markii Rabbigu erayadaas Ayuub kula hadlay dabadeed wuxuu Eliifas oo reer Teemaan ahaa ku yidhi, Cadhadaydii baa ku kululaatay adiga iyo labadaadii saaxiibba, waayo, idinku wixii xaqa ahaa igama aydaan sheegin, sidii addoonkayga Ayuub uu yeelay oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba sidaas daraaddeed waxaad soo wadataan toddoba dibi iyo toddoba wan, oo waxaad u tagtaan addoonkayga Ayuub, oo waxaad nafsaddiinna daraaddeed u bixisaan qurbaan la gubo; oo addoonkayga Ayuub wuu idiin ducaynayaa, waayo, isagaan ka aqbalayaa, si aanan idinkula macaamiloon sidii nacasnimadiinnii ahayd, waayo, idinku wixii xaqa ahaa igama aydaan sheegin sidii addoonkayga Ayuub uu yeelay oo kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Eliifas oo ahaa reer Teemaan, iyo Bildad oo ahaa reer Shuuxii, iyo Soofar oo ahaa reer Nacamaatii way tageen oo waxay u sameeyeen sidii Rabbigu ku amray, oo Rabbiguna Ayuub wuu aqbalay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga ayaa Ayuub axwaalkiisii beddelay markuu saaxiibbadiis u duceeyey; oo Rabbiguna Ayuub wuxuu siiyey wixii uu markii hore lahaa laba jibbaarkood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Ayuub waxaa u yimid walaalihiis oo dhan, wiilal iyo gabdhoba, iyo kuwii isaga hore u yiqiin oo dhan, oo gurigiisii ayay kibis kula cuneen, wayna u tacsiyeeyeen, oo waxay uga qalbi qaboojiyeen masiibadii Rabbigu isaga ku soo dejiyey oo dhan. Oo nin kastaaba wuxuu isagii siiyey in lacag ah iyo hilqad dahab ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo sidaasuu Rabbigu Ayuub ugudambaystiisii u barakeeyey in ka sii badan bilowgiisii hore; oo wuxuu lahaa afar iyo toban kun oo ido ah, iyo lix kun oo geel ah, iyo laba kun oo dibi, iyo kun dameerood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba wuxuu lahaa toddoba wiil iyo saddex gabdhood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo middii kowaad magaceedii wuxuu u bixiyey Yemiimaah, tii labaad magaceediina wuxuu u bixiyey Qasicaah, tii saddexaad magaceediina wuxuu u bixiyey Qeren Hafuug. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waddankaas oo dhanna laguma arag dumar u qurxoon sida gabdhaha Ayuub, oo aabbahoodna dhaxal buu walaalahood la siiyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigaas dabadeed Ayuub wuxuu noolaa boqol iyo afartan sannadood, oo wuxuu arkay wiilashiisii, iyo wiilashiisa wiilashoodiiba, tan iyo intii afar fac ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Ayuub dhintay isagoo duq ah oo cimri weyn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
